{%- comment -%}
  Single source of truth for the free-shipping threshold.

  Returns the amount in CENTS (minor units) for the active presentment
  currency, so the same value can drive both the arithmetic in the cart and
  the copy in the announcement bar. Formatting is NOT done here — run the
  result through 'jkl-money', which is currency-aware.

  Usage (arithmetic):
    {%- capture fs_cents -%}{% render 'jkl-shipping-threshold' %}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign fs_cents = fs_cents | strip | plus: 0 -%}

  Usage (display):
    {%- capture fs_amount -%}{% render 'jkl-money', cents: fs_cents %}{%- endcapture -%}

  Consumers: jkl-header (announcement bar), jkl-cart-drawer, jkl-cart.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign iso = cart.currency.iso_code | default: shop.currency

  case iso
    when 'DKK'
      assign cents = 250000
    when 'SEK'
      assign cents = 250000
    when 'NOK'
      assign cents = 250000
    when 'EUR'
      assign cents = 35000
    else
      assign cents = 250000
  endcase
-%}
{{- cents -}}
